        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Charming Two Bedroom End of Terrace Home with Excellent Curb Appeal\r\nNestled along the ever-popular Kildare Road in Crumlin, this charming two bedroom end of terrace home offers a wonderful opportunity for a discerning purchaser seeking a property with character, generous upstairs accommodation and an attractive residential setting. With its appealing walled front garden, mature hedging and excellent curb appeal, the property is sure to catch your eye for all the right reasons.\r\nOn entering, the entrance hall leads directly to the upper accommodation and opens into a warm and inviting front reception room, providing a lovely space for relaxing and entertaining family and friends. The room features an idyllic fireplace and benefits from useful storage tucked neatly beneath the stairs, making excellent use of the space. To the rear, the kitchen overlooks the garden and provides a practical setting for everyday living, with the garden views providing wonderful light an airy setting. The rear garden is a generous size, boasting excellent scope to extend to the rear (SPP), offering a fantastic opportunity to create a bespoke, modern family home. \r\nUpstairs, the accommodation is particularly appealing, with two generous bright double bedrooms and a spacious family bathroom. \r\nSituated in this ever-popular and mature residential area, the property is surrounded by a host of local amenities, including primary and secondary schools, local shops, parks and sports facilities, all within easy reach. The area is also serviced by excellent public transport links to Dublin City Centre and surrounding areas, while the Red Luas Line is approximately a 15-minute walk from your door. The M50 and N7 motorways are also a short drive away, providing easy access to the greater Dublin area and surrounding counties.\r\nKildare Road is a well-established residential location that continues to appeal to a wide range of purchasers. Combining attractive curb appeal, generous bedroom accommodation, a low-maintenance garden and a highly convenient location, this lovely home is sure to appeal to those looking to put down roots in this popular part of Crumlin.\r\nViewing is highly recommended and by appointment only.\r\n\r\nFEATURES\r\nEnd of Terrace\r\nGreat Location\r\nDouble Glazed\r\nGFCH"
      },
